type: software
title: "Allelio"
abstract: "Privacy-first, fully local genomic variant analysis with AI-powered plain-English explanations. Reads raw genotype data from 23andMe, AncestryDNA, or VCF, cross-references it against ClinVar, the GWAS Catalog, and gnomAD, and never sends genomic data off the user's machine."
